Bind Npc 16051 Zone 2

On greeting
    If quest 220 is started and player has 910050000
        Say "I'm the Guard of the First Key! You are qualified to answer the question since you possess the [Written Order of Seven Keys]. Do you want to hear it?"
        Topic "Accepted" do
            Say "What kind of power does Cypher have?"
            Topic "Power that makes everything vanish" do
                Transaction
                    Take 1 of 910050000
                    Give 1 of 910051000
            Topic "Power that creates everything" do
                Transaction
                    Take 1 of 910050000
                    Say "Your answer is incorrect. As a penalty, the [Written Order of the Seven Keys] you possessed has been destroyed. Now, I will leave to search for the secret of the keys elsewhere."
        Topic "Rejected" goto close
    Else if quest 220 is started
        Say "I'm the Guard of the First Key! I only pose the question to those who bring the [Written Order of Seven Keys]."
    Else
        Say ""
